    {
      "id": 213,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "policy_train ÷ micro-step count",
      "description": "Driver `policy_train` ÷ `micro_step_count`, with the count on the right axis. FSDP all-gathers parameters once per micro-step. If the count halves and this ratio stays flat, `policy_train` halved. If the ratio doubles, nothing was saved.",
